- **Learning Rate:** Lower values (around 0.164) appear more effective in achieving higher accuracy compared to a higher learning rate of 0.230.
- **Network Depth:** Deeper networks with four layers seem to perform better than shallower ones, indicating that the additional depth helps capture intricate molecular features.

These insights can guide further hyperparameter tuning and model development for improved performance in predicting molecular properties relevant to drug discovery datasets.
